WEBVTT

00:02:58.806 --> 00:03:00.048
they become a team.

00:03:00.072 --> 00:03:02.297
And once you engage
the psychology of teams,

00:03:02.321 --> 00:03:04.321
it shuts down open-minded thinking.

00:03:06.801 --> 00:03:09.072
When the liberal team loses,

00:03:09.096 --> 00:03:10.918
[United States of Canada / Jesusland]

00:03:10.942 --> 00:03:13.598
as it did in 2004,
and as it almost did in 2000,

00:03:13.622 --> 00:03:14.976
we comfort ourselves.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.175
(Laughter)

00:03:16.199 --> 00:03:20.447
We try to explain why half of America
voted for the other team.

00:03:20.471 --> 00:03:23.388
We think they must be blinded by religion

00:03:23.412 --> 00:03:25.651
[Post-election US map:
America / Dumbf*ckistan]

00:03:25.675 --> 00:03:27.004
or by simple stupidity.

00:03:27.028 --> 00:03:28.823
(Laughter)

00:03:28.847 --> 00:03:31.671
(Applause)